## Scenario 2 - Partial mitigation (live, read-only)
Flag fsops_tmp_override: Production default disabled earlier in the audit; an identity override keeps it ON for vip-user. This is what an incident looks like after a disable when an override exists.
### $ python .kiro\skills\flag-incident-response\scripts\check_effect.py --flag fsops_tmp_override --env Production --identity ordinary-user --identity vip-user
(exit: 1)
```
