vip-user                 on  reason=TARGETING_MATCH; segment=identity_overrides
PARTIAL: feature still on for vip-user
Incident: NOT VERIFIED: ask the user to confirm the symptom is gone
```
Result: PARTIAL, exit 1. The skill names vip-user and does not change the override (rule: overrides are reported, never changed).

